# Universal Exam Prompt — Agent Configuration for Windsurf

## How This Repo Works

This is a universal skill hub for AI-powered exam preparation for ANY university worldwide.
Skills are in `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — each is a complete instruction set for an AI agent.

## Key Files

- `AGENTS.md` — Machine-readable registry of all skills (auto-discovered by Windsurf)
- `CLAUDE.md` — Quick skill reference table
- `USE-CASES.md` — 33 real-world workflow examples
- `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — Full skill instructions

